  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/29) by Former user (Bitbucket: [Former user](https://bitbucket.org/Former user), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nPrerequisites:\n\n* Custom Theme \\(e.g. blackfoxx or TooWaGrey\\) enabled\n* Option “Background color of preview: theme-based” enabled\n\nAfter applying a crop selection the preview in Editor mode does not match the selected crop. This only appears when theme-based background color is enabled, using a predefined color fixes the glitch.\n\n[pixls.us](http://pixls.us) threads:\n\n* [https://discuss.pixls.us/t/custom-gtk3-theme-blackfoxx-and-instructions-to-disable-tooltips-in-rt/16240/13](https://discuss.pixls.us/t/custom-gtk3-theme-blackfoxx-and-instructions-to-disable-tooltips-in-rt/16240/13)\n* [https://discuss.pixls.us/t/art-meets-the-aur/16456/14](https://discuss.pixls.us/t/art-meets-the-aur/16456/14?u=guzzisti)\n\n‌\n",
